#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:23
msgid "List saved Author Lists"
msgstr "保存的作者列表"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:24
msgid ""
"Read a bounded page of saved Author List presets. Each preset has its own "
"ID and shortcode. This is configuration, not a list of author profiles. "
"Includes native active/trash status."
msgstr "读取保存的作者列表预设的有限页。每个预设都有自己的 ID 和短代码。这是配置，而不是作者档案列表。包括本机活动/垃圾状态。"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:32
msgid "Read saved Author List"
msgstr "读取保存的作者列表"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:33
msgid ""
"Read one verified list preset, its shortcode and revision hash. Editing a "
"list does not change author profiles, post bylines or Author Boxes."
msgstr "读取一个经过验证的列表预设、其短代码和修订哈希。编辑列表不会更改作者档案、帖子署名或作者框。"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:41
msgid "Discover Author List fields"
msgstr "发现作者列表字段"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:42
msgid ""
"Read native layout, display-field, grouping, image, filter and "
"active-edition search/pagination choices. Pro-only controls appear only "
"with Pro active; promotional controls are excluded."
msgstr "读取本机布局、显示字段、分组、图像、过滤器和活动版的搜索/分页选择。仅在 Pro 处于活动状态时显示专业控制；促销控件被排除。"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:50
msgid "Create or update Author List"
msgstr "创建或更新作者列表"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:51
msgid ""
"Create a list with native title and layout fields, or patch a verified "
"preset using its latest hash. Generates a native publishpress_authors_list "
"shortcode from validated fields. Preserves omitted fields and other lists. "
"Use status active to restore a trashed preset. dry_run previews without "
"saving."
msgstr ""
"使用本机标题和布局字段创建列表，或使用其最新哈希修补经过验证的预设。从验证的字段生成本机 publishpress_authors_list "
"短代码。保留省略的字段和其他列表。使用状态活动来恢复已删除的预设。dry_run 预览而不保存。"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:64
msgid "Trash or delete Author List"
msgstr "垃圾或删除作者列表"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:65
msgid ""
"Trash a verified saved list, or explicitly use permanent true to remove its "
"preset. Requires the latest hash. Does not delete posts or author profiles. "
"dry_run checks without saving."
msgstr "将经过验证的保存列表放入垃圾中，或明确使用永久 true 来删除其预设。需要最新哈希。不会删除帖子或作者档案。dry_run 检查而不保存。"

#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:111
#: src/core/Mcp/Lists.php:127
